---- note on the `[moe-vrows-pack] engaged` line ----

That announce belongs to door M and appears because gate 5's LAST arm deliberately arms
`MEMRA_MOE_VROWS_PACK=1` to prove door M REFUSES both dedup schedules. The assertion on that arm is
that both dedup counters stay FLAT, which the PASS line reports. It is not the dedup door engaging.
